# Hazard Pressure 2 of 10 — the route tax.
# Terrain and placement share one grid, so the board is what it looks like.
#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot
#   any other letter = an enemy declared by a 'spawn' line below
#
# A spike belt cuts the board in half with exactly one clean gap. Walking spikes costs
# 1 movement and 1 damage and does not Stagger; being SHOVED onto them costs 3 and does.
# Player B starts north of the belt, alone with both Lobbers, which is the clock.

id: hz-short-way
number: 202
name: The Short Way
description: A belt of spikes with one gap. Cross it and bleed, queue for the gap and lose a round, or leave Player B alone under two lobbers.

spawn l = Lobber
spawn s = Stalker
spawn h = Husk

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

board:
  ..l...l..
  ...#.#BBB
  ^^^^.^^^^
  .........
  H.......H
  A...s....
  AA....h..
